    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="hi">लेखिका के बारे में</span><span class="en">About the author</span></div>
      <h2><span class="hi hin">वह आवाज़ जिसने दुनिया को छोटी चीज़ों का देवता दिया।</span><span class="en">The voice that gave the world The God of Small Things.</span></h2>
      <p>
        <span class="hi">अरुंधति रॉय के पहले उपन्यास <em>The God of Small Things</em> ने उन्हें 1997 का बुकर पुरस्कार दिलाया और रातोंरात दुनिया-भर का पाठक। इसके बाद उन्होंने अपनी कलम को अन्याय, अल्पसंख्यक-अधिकार और सत्ता के सवालों की ओर मोड़ा — निबंधों और <em>The Ministry of Utmost Happiness</em> जैसी रचनाओं के ज़रिए।</span>
        <span class="en">Arundhati Roy’s first novel, <em>The God of Small Things</em>, won the 1997 Booker Prize and readers the world over. She then turned her pen toward injustice, minority rights and power — through her essays and the novel <em>The Ministry of Utmost Happiness</em>.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="hi">“मेरी माँ मेरी गैंगस्टर” उनकी पहली स्मृति-कथा है — और शायद उनकी सबसे साहसी। इसका शीर्षक बीटल्स के गीत “Let It Be” की एक पंक्ति से आया है, और इसका केंद्र है वह स्त्री जिसने रॉय को गढ़ा भी और आज़माया भी।</span>
        <span class="en">“Mother Mary Comes To Me” is her first memoir — and perhaps her bravest. Its title comes from a line in The Beatles’ “Let It Be,” and at its centre is the woman who shaped Roy and tested her in equal measure.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="torn" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 1440 26" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0,26 L0,10.6 L31.3,7.0 L62.6,17.4 L93.9,5.4 L125.2,15.0 L156.5,11.5 L187.8,5.1 L219.1,14.5 L250.4,4.7 L281.7,12.9 L313.0,5.4 L344.3,5.8 L375.7,12.7 L407.0,21.1 L438.3,6.5 L469.6,8.5 L500.9,17.0 L532.2,23.6 L563.5,15.9 L594.8,12.2 L626.1,24.2 L657.4,4.9 L688.7,21.8 L720.0,9.9 L751.3,6.9 L782.6,6.4 L813.9,10.3 L845.2,20.9 L876.5,7.7 L907.8,16.0 L939.1,17.2 L970.4,11.6 L1001.7,15.3 L1033.0,5.2 L1064.3,5.1 L1095.7,8.2 L1127.0,18.1 L1158.3,12.8 L1189.6,10.4 L1220.9,16.1 L1252.2,13.3 L1283.5,10.1 L1314.8,20.4 L1346.1,18.4 L1377.4,9.0 L1408.7,15.8 L1440.0,14.8 L1440,26 Z" fill="var(--red)"/></svg></div>

<!-- ============ ORDER ============ -->
<section class="order" id="order" style="padding:clamp(50px,7vw,90px) 0 clamp(64px,9vw,110px)">
  <div class="wrap order-grid">
    <div class="order-intro reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="hi">अभी बुक करें</span><span class="en">Reserve now</span></div>
      <h2><span class="hi hin">अपनी क्रमांकित<br>प्रति सुरक्षित करें।</span><span class="en">Reserve your<br>numbered copy.</span></h2>
      <p><span class="hi">1500 में से एक बनें। भुगतान होते ही आपकी एडिशन संख्या आरक्षित हो जाती है और लॉन्च पर सीधे आपके पते पर पहुँचती है।</span><span class="en">Be one of 1500. Your edition number is reserved the moment you pay, and ships straight to your door at launch.</span></p>
      <ul class="order-perks">
        <li><span class="ic">✎</span><span><span class="hi">लेखिका के हाथ से हस्ताक्षरित — नीले जेल पेन से, हर प्रति असली।</span><span class="en">Signed by the author’s hand — in blue gel pen, every copy genuine.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="ic">№</span><span><span class="hi">क्रमांकित एडिशन — आपकी अपनी संख्या, 1 से 1500 तक।</span><span class="en">A numbered edition — your own number, 1 to 1500.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="ic">✦</span><span><span class="hi">हस्ताक्षरित शीर्षक-पृष्ठ — हर किताब में।</span><span class="en">A signed title page — in every book.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="ic">↦</span><span><span class="hi">निःशुल्क डिलीवरी — पूरे भारत में।</span><span class="en">Free delivery — across India.</span></span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="form-card reveal">
      <h3><span class="hi hin">बुकिंग विवरण</span><span class="en">Booking details</span></h3>
      <div class="fsub">Signed Limited Edition · ₹1499</div>

      <div class="frow"><div class="field">
        <label><span class="hi">पूरा नाम</span><span class="en">Full name</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="f_name" autocomplete="name" data-ph-hi="आपका नाम" data-ph-en="Your name" placeholder="आपका नाम">
        <div class="msg" data-for="f_name"></div>
      </div></div>

      <div class="frow two">
        <div class="field"><label><span class="hi">ईमेल</span><span class="en">Email</span></label>
          <input type="email" id="f_email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="name@email.com"><div class="msg" data-for="f_email"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label><span class="hi">फ़ोन</span><span class="en">Phone</span></label>
          <input type="tel" id="f_phone" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="10" data-ph-hi="10 अंकों का नंबर" data-ph-en="10-digit number" placeholder="10 अंकों का नंबर"><div class="msg" data-for="f_phone"></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="frow"><div class="field">
        <label><span class="hi">पता</span><span class="en">Shipping address</span></label>
        <textarea id="f_addr" autocomplete="street-address" data-ph-hi="मकान, गली, इलाका" data-ph-en="House, street, area" placeholder="मकान, गली, इलाका"></textarea>
        <div class="msg" data-for="f_addr"></div>
      </div></div>

      <div class="frow two">
        <div class="field"><label><span class="hi">शहर</span><span class="en">City</span></label>
          <input type="text" id="f_city" data-ph-hi="शहर" data-ph-en="City" placeholder="शहर"><div class="msg" data-for="f_city"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label><span class="hi">पिन कोड</span><span class="en">PIN code</span></label>
          <input type="text" id="f_pin" maxlength="6" data-ph-hi="6 अंक" data-ph-en="6 digits" placeholder="6 अंक"><div class="msg" data-for="f_pin"></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="qty-row">
        <div class="ql"><span class="hi hin">प्रतियाँ</span><span class="en">Copies</span><em>MAX 3 PER PERSON</em></div>
        <div class="stepper">
          <button type="button" id="qMinus" aria-label="−">–</button>
          <input type="text" id="qty" value="1" readonly aria-label="quantity">
          <button type="button" id="qPlus" aria-label="+">+</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="summary">
        <div class="sline"><span><span class="hi">प्रति ×</span><span class="en">Copies ×</span> <span id="sQty">1</span></span><span>₹<span id="sSub">1499</span></span></div>
        <div class="sline"><span><span class="hi">डिलीवरी</span><span class="en">Delivery</span></span><span class="free"><span class="hi">निःशुल्क</span><span class="en">Free</span></span></div>
        <div class="sline total"><span><span class="hi">कुल देय</span><span class="en">Total payable</span></span><b>₹<span id="sTotal">1499</span></b></div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn btn--red pay-btn" id="payBtn" type="button"></button>
      <div class="pay-note"><span class="hi">सुरक्षित भुगतान · UPI / कार्ड / नेट-बैंकिंग · Powered by Razorpay</span><span class="en">Secure payment · UPI / Card / Net-banking · Powered by Razorpay</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->
<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="foot-grid">
      <div class="foot-brand">
        <div class="fb-mark"><span class="hi">राजकमल प्रकाशन</span><span class="en">Rajkamal Prakashan</span></div>
        <p><span class="hi">हिंदी साहित्य का घर, 1949 से। श्रेष्ठ लेखन, सुंदर पुस्तकें।</span><span class="en">Home of Hindi literature since 1949. Great writing, beautiful books.</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="foot-col">
        <h4><span class="hi">पुस्तक</span><span class="en">The book</span></h4>
        <a href="#edition"><span class="hi">हस्ताक्षरित संस्करण</span><span class="en">Signed edition</span></a>
        <a href="#book"><span class="hi">पुस्तक के बारे में</span><span class="en">About the book</span></a>
        <a href="#author"><span class="hi">लेखिका</span><span class="en">The author</span></a>
